Changes added downstream (not present upstream)
-----------------------------------------------
  - CardKit AI streaming status with real total token usage
  - Per-app isolation and multi-user management
  - Manual Lark credential setup channel alongside QR auth
  - Per-conversation reasoning-effort controls
  - Session administration, aliases and task registry
